WEBVTT

0
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:07.660
Sprezzature is an AI engine for Design.
Accessibility reads your HTML.

1
00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:11.220
20 rules, and not one
of them opens a browser.

2
00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:14.420
A video starts playing
by itself, with sound.

3
00:00:14.620 --> 00:00:19.307
A blind reader cannot now hear the
screen reader they would use to stop it.

4
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.680
And the page is valid.
No validator says a word about it.

5
00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:35.120
Here is the page. Line 5 is the trap:
autoplay with sound.

6
00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:41.037
Each finding names the element,
the line, and the rule.

7
00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:45.760
3 of the 6 on this page
sit on that one line.

8
00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:51.480
Standard library for the lint.
One dependency, for the command line.

9
00:00:54.600 --> 00:00:58.040
6 of the 20 repair themselves. Only 6.

10
00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:02.840
A repair is automatic only where
exactly one repair is safe.

11
00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.800
The other 14 are reported,
and never guessed at.

12
00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:12.587
The exception is the alt text,
drafted from the image and the page.

13
00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:23.039
Shown the pixels alone, the draft was
a dark coat and a patterned shirt.

14
00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:29.120
Given the page as well, it wrote Paris,
the Institute, the decade.

15
00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:34.750
None of that was in the photograph.
And it is still a draft.

16
00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:45.800
Go to sprezzature.ai,
and drop a GitHub star if it deserves it.

17
00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:51.440
Make it, audit it, take a look at it.
